#showas:扭曲倒影
#sortorder:4
This scenario presents a new and potentially explosive war in addition to the one between humanity and the AI.  The galaxy is a Chaotic one with 90 planets.

A powerful Dark Spire incursion will, starting at an hour and a half in, come under fire from the Gray and Chromatic Spheres.  This state of affairs is known as the Splintering Spire.

You may wish to hack all or none of them for various assets, some of them quite exotic and powerful.   

Two difficulty 7 AIs are also present, both of which can be annoying if care is not exercised.  The Ghost will deploy a lot of cloaked assets, while the Thief uses ships that like to tractor yours off to parts unknown.  

Stay alert, and keep your wits about you.  